COWPROBE(1)

NAME
    cowprobe - test copy-on-write behavior

SYNOPSIS
    cowprobe

DESCRIPTION
    Exercises fork-time copy-on-write sharing, private-page breakaway after
    writes, and child wait cleanup.

    The probe also checks memory-accounting visibility: shared PMM frame
    accounting should rise after fork and fall again after the child exits.

NOTES
    This is primarily a diagnostic or self-test helper, but it is documented so installed programs are discoverable.
